      "assessment": "partially",
      "cannot_verify_reason": null,
      "evidence_summary": "Appendix A.1 states 'Listings from January to April 2024 are missing due to a gap in the listing text data', and the Figure 3 caption says 'missing listing text from January to April 2024'. April is in Q2, so the gap covers more than the first quarter. The Figure 3 image shows a break after the Q4 2023 point and the next point at about the second quarter of 2024, so that quarter appears to be plotted from May-June listings only. The manuscript does not say whether the Q2 2024 value is a partial-quarter estimate. This affects the comparability of that point with other quarters, though not the headline 35 to 44 percent trend.",
