      "finding_summary": "The 44-project and 96-article totals of Section 6 cannot be mapped to the pilot and rounds 2-4 sets: the pilot's Homborsund and Stod projects are not said to be inside the 43 projects from rounds 2-4, yet footnote 3 builds 44 as 43 plus Stord only.",
