      "evidence_summary": "Section 5 and Table 6 are scoped to 'rounds 2-4' (3,187 articles, 92 relevant, 43 projects). Footnote 3 adds four pilot-run articles and the Stord project to reach 96 articles and 44 projects. The pilot, however, also contains the Homborsund (four articles) and Stod (one) openings, which are real projects with articles dated within the October 2025-October 2026 window of rounds 2-4. If those projects are not already in the 43, the total would exceed 44; if they are, their pilot articles may be double counted in 96. The Table 6 day-precision count of 19 equals the Section 6.3 split of 17+2 over 44 projects, which suggests the two sets might coincide, but this is not stated. The base for Table 7 and Section 6.3 is therefore ambiguous. I do not assert an error, only that the set mapping is not documented.",
